# Build context for both images is the repository root — the pnpm workspace is the
# unit that installs, so apps/api cannot be its own context. Keep everything that is
# rebuilt inside the image out of the context, or a stale local dist ships instead.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/.svelte-kit
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo

.git
.github
.claude
docs
infra

# Never let a developer's real secrets into a layer.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# The desktop app is packaged by hand, per OS, and neither image copies its sources —
# but its manifest stays in the context, because `--frozen-lockfile` checks the
# lockfile against every workspace package's package.json, desktop included.
apps/desktop/src
apps/desktop/assets

**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/*.log
.DS_Store
